    title: "GoDaddy Websites vs a Custom Site: What Contractors Give Up",
    metaTitle: "GoDaddy Sites vs Custom: What You Lose",
    excerpt: "What contractors trade away in speed, SEO flexibility, and conversion when they build on GoDaddy's website builder instead of a custom site.",
